                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "pros\n\n+ good looking and detailed graphics\n+ İ love comic magazine style cut scenes. they are very well made.\n+ easy and fun puzzles (if you don't want to challenge). PDA is very helpful for puzzle solutions.\n+ hotspots are marked to make it easy. No need to hunt for pixels.\n+ story is intriguing. you're an detective and investigating some serial murders.\n+ background music is good\n+ game s story very similar to Seven's (1995) story.\n\ncons\n\n- the game mechanics and english translation aren't the best.\n\n\nOverall this is an decent and typical old school point and click adventure game. i m really enjoyed from this game.",
